       "id": "1a.1",
       "text": "Halvern Dam on the Sorrel River at Brindlemark in the Assek Valley was reported damaged on 9 September 2025, opening a dam safety emergency.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.2",
       "text": "Damage extended to the right abutment, and the alert level was raised from Yellow to Orange the following morning.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.3",
       "text": "The principal human impact was displacement, with roughly 11,800 residents evacuated from Brindlemark and further residents evacuated from Ferris Hollow.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "A mandatory evacuation was in progress at the end of the window, with the dam operator providing information on the situation.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
